# Mission Dashboard

- Canonical app: FastAPI + HTMX in `web/` (Railway). Business logic in `app/`.
- Streamlit was removed. Do not reintroduce `Mission_Dashboard.py` or `pages/`.
- Production DB: Turso (`TURSO_URL` / `TURSO_TOKEN`). Never commit `.env` or secrets.
- Stripe webhook canónico: `POST /stripe/webhook`. Checkout return: `/app/billing?checkout=…`.
- Prefer small PRs on `cursor/<name>-8925`; base `main`.
- Tests: `pytest -q tests/` (includes `test_web_smoke.py`). Local SQLite: `MISSION_ALLOW_SQLITE=1 SESSION_SECRET=dev`. Deploy check: `python scripts/verify_deploy.py $APP_URL`.
- Deploy checklist: `CUTOVER.md`.
